WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.834
-It's great to see you, and
thanks for being on the show.

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:05.667
I want to talk about
"Wakanda Forever,"

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.601
but can we just talk about --

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.901
"Black Panther" was your --
was that your first role?

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.734
No?
-Was, indeed, my first role.

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:14.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.033
-I'm sorry.
Your first role?

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:18.801
-Yeah, yeah.
-Not too shabby, huh?

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:20.634
-Not too shabby at all.
-No.

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:21.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:24.601
-It's -- It was very just, like,

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.234
mind-blowing showing up
on set the first day.

00:00:27.234 --> 00:00:29.734
And it's like, okay,
turn left, Angela Bassett.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:33.334
-Yeah. And now "Black Panther:
Wakanda Forever."

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.501
Everyone cannot wait
to see this.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.734
November 11th.
We're all psyched to see it.

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:41.901
It's bigger, it's just giant,
action-packed.

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:44.634
But then we just heard
that Rihanna has a song in it.

00:00:44.634 --> 00:00:47.334
[ Cheers and applause ]
-The Queen.

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.200
The Queen herself.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.234
-And that's her first song
in six years.

00:00:51.234 --> 00:00:52.767
-[ Laughs ]
-Everyone's going crazy for it.

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.734
-This is what the wait was for.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:56.767
They were just -- we were just
waiting for "Wakanda Forever."

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:58.133
-Yeah.
Have you gotten --

00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:00.501
Did you ever get to --
Did you get to meet Rihanna?

00:01:00.501 --> 00:01:03.734
-I did.
I got to meet Rihanna in 2019.

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:05.567
-Whoo!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.567
-Yeah, wait till
you hear the story, so...

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.567
I never --
I have to say,

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:15.067
I never get starstruck,
and that was the night.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:17.000
-Really?
-I had a lot of, like,

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.934
plans in my head for years.
Because we're both Caribbean.

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:22.200
I'm from Trinidad.
She's from Barbados.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.067
You know,
and I had all these ideas.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:27.767
I'm like, "I'm gonna
chat her up on like Carnivale,

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:30.767
Crop Over, talk about art."
-Yes!

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.934
-You know, we've got some vibes.
I was like, "We got this."

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.868
[ Laughter ]
And then, I saw her,

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:39.234
and a friend introduced,
and I was like,

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:42.133
"Hey, you know, my friend
wasn't supposed to be so crass.

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.100
You know, he knows I love you."

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.033
And she goes, "Oh, thank you,
thank you, thank you."

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:48.501
And I was like, "I'm Winston,
Winston Duke."

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:50.167
She was like,
"I'm aware of who you are."

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:53.000
And she looked at me.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.334
She was like, "Yeah, I know
exactly who you are."

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:59.300
[ Laughter ]
And I was like, "Ah, ha!"

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.467
-She froze you up?
-Oh, I folded.

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:05.067
-Really?
-Like fresh laundry, my friend.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:06.400
I was --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:10.634
I was -- I was stunned.
I was like, "So, um, buh, bah --

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:12.434
Well, uh,
where'd you come from?"

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:14.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.400
That was it!
That was my line.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.701
That was it.
That's what came out.

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:19.267
-You've been waiting to meet
Rihanna your whole --

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:20.801
-And I said,
"Where'd you come from?"

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:24.367
And she said, "Uh, my house."

00:02:24.367 --> 00:02:26.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:27.767
And I aborted.
-"I came from my house."

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:30.000
-No, no, I aborted.
I aborted immediately.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.267
I was like, "It's such
a pleasure meeting you,"

00:02:32.267 --> 00:02:34.367
and I walked off,
and my boy came, was like,

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:36.067
"So, how'd it go?"
and I was like,

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:37.634
"I asked her
where she was from."

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:39.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:40.567
[ Sad tuba ]

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:42.868
♪ Bwah, bwah, bwah ♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:45.367
And he was like,
"From heaven, fool!

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:48.400
You know!
You know where she's from!"

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.033
-From heaven, yeah.
-"Go back, go back.

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.400
Get on the horse,
get back on the horse."

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.734
And I was like, "No, man."
-She must have loved you,

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:56.767
though, because she asked you to
be in her upcoming fashion show.

00:02:56.767 --> 00:03:00.400
-Yes, yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.767
-I mean, come on.

00:03:01.767 --> 00:03:03.834
-You know,
the legs will be out.

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:06.300
-Oh. Thank you.
Congratulations on that.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.133
-The legs will be oiled,
and they're gonna be out.

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:11.934
I will be a savage Fenty man.

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:13.667
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yes.

00:03:13.667 --> 00:03:16.400
-"Wakanda Forever,"
the movie pays tribute

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.567
to Chadwick Boseman,
who we're all so sad

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:21.901
that he's not with us.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.868
It must have been difficult
to film this.

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:28.734
-Yeah.
I mean, it was very --

00:03:28.734 --> 00:03:32.834
Just a lot of emotions
every day, a lot of grief.

00:03:32.834 --> 00:03:36.267
And since none of us knew
he was even sick,

00:03:36.267 --> 00:03:38.801
it was so much
for everyone included.

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:43.000
It was, you know, all the way
from Ryan to the cast,

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.167
all the producers.

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:46.934
So, you know,
right before the first day,

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:49.534
they took us to his grave site,

00:03:49.534 --> 00:03:52.501
and we all, as a cast,
said goodbye.

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:55.534
We all said our goodbye
and, like, told stories of,

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:58.701
you know, what he meant to us
and started the show and bonded.

00:03:58.701 --> 00:04:02.067
And even though we'd all be
grieving on different days,

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:04.133
it was good to know
that you kind of had

00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:07.868
a community around you that
could pick you up on that day.

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:10.133
And when the other person's
grieving on their day,

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:11.267
you pick them up, you know?

00:04:11.267 --> 00:04:12.801
So, it helped.
-Yeah.

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:17.133
Yeah, I think people are gonna
enjoy this film, the tribute.

00:04:17.133 --> 00:04:20.100
-Yeah.
It is an honorable film.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.067
It is a film
that is the perfect film

00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:25.801
for the last three years
of our lives.

00:04:25.801 --> 00:04:27.701
We have all lost.
We've all suffered.

00:04:27.701 --> 00:04:30.100
We've all felt,
you know, deep grief.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.033
And it's about
coming through that.

00:04:32.033 --> 00:04:33.601
[ Applause ]

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:35.467
-We need it.
-Yeah, we all need it.

00:04:35.467 --> 00:04:36.968
-We need it.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:39.634
Do you remember the first time
you worked with Chadwick?

00:04:39.634 --> 00:04:41.567
-[ Chuckles ]
Yeah.

00:04:41.567 --> 00:04:45.234
So, the first time
I met Chadwick

00:04:45.234 --> 00:04:51.367
was the final audition,
the screen test.

00:04:51.367 --> 00:04:55.400
And we were going through
the scenes, and they're like,

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.667
"We just want to see how you
guys are gonna be together,

00:04:58.667 --> 00:05:00.200
like, how you're gonna play.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.434
So could you wrestle
or something?

00:05:02.434 --> 00:05:04.000
Could you wrestle around?"

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.400
And I'm like, "Okay, all right."
[ Laughter ]

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.901
"If that's gonna get me this
job, I'm gonna wrestle."

00:05:09.901 --> 00:05:12.267
And we start wrestling,
and he's a martial artist,

00:05:12.267 --> 00:05:14.100
so he can hold his own.
You know what I mean?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.267
I wrestled, you know,
all through high school

00:05:16.267 --> 00:05:18.534
and started a little bit
in college.

00:05:18.534 --> 00:05:24.367
And I got in there,
and I, like, crouched down.

00:05:24.367 --> 00:05:25.501
And the first thing
that happened

00:05:25.501 --> 00:05:29.634
was my pants split open.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.634 --> 00:05:32.033
I tell you, I have
the best things happen to me.

00:05:32.033 --> 00:05:33.601
Let me tell you.
-You really do.

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:35.000
Rihanna and this.
-I'm telling you,

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.601
God has a sense of humor.

00:05:36.601 --> 00:05:37.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:40.033
That is the one thing
I can confirm.

00:05:40.033 --> 00:05:42.501
And I'm like --
I'm one of his favorites.

00:05:42.501 --> 00:05:44.133
-He does these things.
-How did you know?

00:05:44.133 --> 00:05:46.334
Did you hear it?
-Oh, we saw it.

00:05:46.334 --> 00:05:48.000
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.200
-And, you know,
I've always adopted this thing

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.834
when it comes to, like,
auditions.

00:05:53.834 --> 00:05:56.300
I was like, "You know what?
I don't have to book the job.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:59.367
I just have to win the room.
I just have to win the room.

00:05:59.367 --> 00:06:01.834
If I know I win the room,
they'll invite me back someday."

00:06:01.834 --> 00:06:03.334
You know what I mean?
-Yeah.

00:06:03.334 --> 00:06:05.667
-So I always go in places and I
say, "I need to win the room."

00:06:05.667 --> 00:06:07.934
And when I split my pants,
I was like, "I'm winning."

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:09.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:11.868
You know what I mean?
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:06:11.868 --> 00:06:13.234
-I was like, "I'm winning."
-No one else did that.

00:06:13.234 --> 00:06:15.033
-No one else did this!
-No one else did that.

00:06:15.033 --> 00:06:17.200
Yeah, think about it.
You took it to the next level.

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:19.267
-I said, at least --
for the least,

00:06:19.267 --> 00:06:21.100
if I don't get this job --
and I said that to them

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.367
right then and there.
I was like,

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:23.968
"You guys are gonna
have to buy me new pants."

00:06:23.968 --> 00:06:25.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.167 --> 00:06:26.534
-And, uh, yeah, like...

00:06:26.534 --> 00:06:28.934
-I would be intimidated by you.
I mean, you're a big guy.

00:06:28.934 --> 00:06:31.000
-You know, but I can be gentle.
You know what I mean?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.567
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.567 --> 00:06:34.567
Have you ever wrestled?
-No.

00:06:34.567 --> 00:06:36.334
-Never?
-Have I wrestled?

00:06:36.334 --> 00:06:38.734
-Yeah, like in high school?
-Yeah, thumb wrestling.

00:06:38.734 --> 00:06:40.367
Yeah, I was
on the thumb wrestling --

00:06:40.367 --> 00:06:42.767
No, I would never wrestle.
-So you don't know any moves?

00:06:42.767 --> 00:06:44.300
-I don't have any moves, no.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.767
-I can show you a move
if you need,

00:06:45.767 --> 00:06:47.100
if you'd like
to see a little bit.

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:49.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:49.167 --> 00:06:51.901
You know what?
I think we're gonna go

00:06:51.901 --> 00:06:53.167
with the audience.

00:06:53.167 --> 00:06:55.734
-I'm good.
-The audience wants to see --

00:06:55.734 --> 00:06:57.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:57.701 --> 00:07:00.367
The audience...
[ Cheering continues ]

00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:05.400
The audience wants to see
Jimmy Fallon wrestle.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.300
-But I don't want
to wrestle you, though, bud.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.400
You're gonna show me a move
just in case I get in --

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.067
If I get in trouble somewhere,
I can do this move.

00:07:12.067 --> 00:07:14.200
-Okay, so if a guy
is trying to, like, you know --

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.400
Get in your posture.
You might come down. Right?

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.667
-Okay, yeah, come down.
-Crouch down.

00:07:17.667 --> 00:07:19.067
-Yeah, of course.
This is what I do.

00:07:19.067 --> 00:07:20.601
-Like, you can't get in these.
-Okay, yep.

00:07:20.601 --> 00:07:22.968
You can't -- yep.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:22.968 --> 00:07:27.734
-Right. So, I'm gonna show you
a gentle arm slide.

00:07:27.734 --> 00:07:28.834
-Okay.
Arm slide, yep.

00:07:28.834 --> 00:07:30.868
-Into a full Nelson.

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:32.734
[ Laughter ]

00:07:32.734 --> 00:07:34.434
-That sounds too much.
-So, boom.

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:36.434
You've got a little arm control.

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:37.501
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.501 --> 00:07:38.667
See that?
-Yes.

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:40.467
-I'm gonna come under the arm.
-Yeah, I just --

00:07:40.467 --> 00:07:42.033
Right there, so you win.
-Pull you by.

00:07:42.033 --> 00:07:43.501
-Okay, yeah.
-Boom.

00:07:43.501 --> 00:07:47.033
-Yeah, like that.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.968
-Are you still intact?
-Yeah, that was great.

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:51.234
-Okay.
-That was actually good.

00:07:51.234 --> 00:07:53.133
That was good right there.
-Now let's try for real.

00:07:53.133 --> 00:07:55.200
Come on, come on,
come on, come on.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:57.367 --> 00:08:00.067
♪♪

00:08:00.067 --> 00:08:01.767
-[ Grunts ]

00:08:01.767 --> 00:08:04.267
-Pfft! Pfft!
[ Laughs ]

00:08:04.267 --> 00:08:06.567
You made it.
-I made it, I made it.

00:08:06.567 --> 00:08:08.000
-You made it.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.167
Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:11.868
Oh, oh!

00:08:11.868 --> 00:08:13.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:13.367 --> 00:08:15.300
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:16.334
Here's Winston Duke

00:08:16.334 --> 00:08:18.534
in "Black Panther:
Wakanda Forever"!

00:08:18.534 --> 00:08:20.801
